 C4H7 + photon = C4H6 + H
!
! photoabsorption cross section from Bayratceken et al 2006, Spectrochim Acta A: Mol Biomol Spectr, 65, 143, data retrieved from https://uv-vis-spectral-atlas-mainz.org/
!
! photoionization threshold is 156.9 nm (NIST Webbook)
! photoionization yield assumed to be 1 shortwards of ionization threshold and 0 longwards
!
! sigma is the total photoabsorption cross section
! yield is the photodissociation yield relative to photoabsorption
!
